{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281200","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028120001:1":{"text":"さっきは危なかったです。おかげで助かりました……","source_cn":"刚才很危险，多亏有你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC541C8057FB630A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028120002:1":{"text":"魔力を完全に吸収して、最後の記憶をすべて見終えましょう……","source_cn":"让我把逸散的魔力完全吸收，看完最后的回忆吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE457F056E914DA3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1028120002":{"text":"魔力を完全に吸収して、最後の記憶をすべて見終えましょう……","source_cn":"让我把逸散的魔力完全吸收，看完最后的回忆吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE457F056E914DA3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028120003:0":{"text":"イヴォンヌ、外に行ってみたいか分からないのですね？まあ……確かに私でも躊躇はするかもしれません……","source_cn":"伊温，你没想好要不要出去吗？嗯……这个问题要是问我的话...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3E69E5E4A8354BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028120004:0":{"text":"フラベルさん、わたし……ずっとここにいたいです。ここで、ターラン川が育むすべての命を助けたい……","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，我……我想永远留在这里，帮助所有塔兰河抚育的生灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9F032159DC874AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028120005:0":{"text":"わたし……意気地なしですよね？","source_cn":"我是不是……很没出息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39242CA83D189A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028120006:0":{"text":"まさか！どこにいても、君の力は優しい雨粒となって……","source_cn":"怎么会呢？无论在哪里，你的力量都会化成温柔的雨滴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E0EF71E6333EB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028120007:0":{"text":"「恋人たちの祈り」に降り注げば、草花を生い茂らせ、水に落ちれば、ターラン川に乗って遠くへ流れていく……","source_cn":"落在情人之愿，就能滋润这里的花草；落在水中，就会随着塔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF63133A9C7CD9CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028120008:0":{"text":"イヴォンヌ、それはとても素晴らしいことです！自分が望むことを知るのは、立派な勇気ですよ！","source_cn":"伊温，这样很好呀！你知道自己最想要的是什么，这也是一种勇气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD92E9BAC01D26864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028120009:0":{"text":"わたしに……勇気が？","source_cn":"我……勇气？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E40B20D0F415817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028120010:0":{"text":"ええ！未知と危険を前に、大胆に突き進むのも勇気がいりますが、心と向き合い、自分の進むべき道を選ぶのも勇気のいる行動です。","source_cn":"当然了！面对陌生和危险，大胆向前，这是勇气；但直面内心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4593EBA8AC6FCF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028120011:0":{"text":"イヴォンヌ、君は私が思う以上に勇敢ですね。","source_cn":"伊温，你比你想象中更加勇敢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC194B998D95CB88D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028120012:0":{"text":"フラベルさん、ありがとうございます……","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF53D6E827C0761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028120013:0":{"text":"これが……本当のイヴォンヌさんの記憶だったんですね。","source_cn":"原来……这才是伊温小姐真正的回忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14F3722BD3EB402D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028120014:1":{"text":"今まで色んな褒め言葉を聞いてきましたが、「勇気がある」と言われたのは彼女が初めてでした。","source_cn":"我听过许多不同的赞美，可那是第一次有人说我“有勇气”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x787051403D7C9D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028120015:0":{"text":"フラベルさんに教えてもらったんです。外の危険に立ち向かうことだけが勇気ではなく、自分の心と向き合うのも勇気なのだと……",